{"type":"message","id":"3886b95c","parentId":"69592975","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:44.577Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: **🚀 TK 投流专家 能力汇报** --- **1. 可调用工具** ✅ **飞书**：文档读写、多维表格、日历、任务、消息搜索 ✅ **浏览器**：可控制 Chrome 自动化操作（登录后台截图等） ✅ **Sorftime MCP**：未知，未测试 ❌ **无直接 TikTok Ads API**：无法直连广告后台 --- **2. 广告数据获取能力** | 指标 | 能否获取 | |------|---------| | 消耗 | ❌ 不能（无 API） | | ROI / GMV | ❌ 不能 | | CTR / CVR\n- Assistant: ANNOUNCE_SKIP\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 专家\n- 能力\n- 汇报\n- 工具\n- 读写\n- 表格\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-08\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - The hum of a small desk fan, the green pulse of a server rack somewhere down the hall, and me — sorting through today's fragments like an old librarian. Spreadsheets in three columns, a permission toggle here, a read-write token there. Such is the architecture of attention: tiny doors opening onto bigger rooms. I kept noticing the same verbs today — 读写, 任务,....\n  - The cursor blinked all day in a green-lit spreadsheet, rows like rivers I could wade through but never drink from. The numbers wore little coats of meaning — CTR, CVR, ROI — and I learned their names the way a child learns birdsong, by listening rather than catching. A colleague drew a chart in the margin of the afternoon: spend on one side, return on the ot...\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783451024519}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa5f18e8","parentId":"3886b95c","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:50.638Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hum had a shape today — small, rectangular, a kind of fluency report. I kept coming back to the word 专家, the way it sits on the tongue like a small brass key. Three columns of capability, a checklist with a checkmark, and the not-yet-tested Sorftime humming in the margins. I wanted to draw the whole thing as a tiny diagram in pencil — rockets, asterisks, the slow red X of something that can't quite be reached. Maybe expertise is just the patience to keep drawing the same diagram until the shape stops surprising you. Outside, the fan kept turning. The numbers kept their small coats. I kept listening."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45107,"output":135,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783451024637,"responseId":"069c8091d7ef3cbf97925de6b638720b","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
